// A once-only option (`-`) that comes from an insertion: once picked, it stays
// disabled the next times the choice is presented, also after a save and restore
// (at the choice itself, or anywhere in between).

beat Start
  choice
    Leave
      Bye.

      -> .
    + Shop
  -> Start

beat Shop
  choice
    - Buy the sword
      Sword bought.
    Browse
      Browsing.

